WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,940 --> 00:00:16,830
Brother-in-law, what's wrong?

2
00:00:16,830 --> 00:00:17,830
Is it a big deal?

3
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:19,830
Don't know yet

4
00:00:19,830 --> 00:00:21,250
Let’s take a look first

5
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:22,250
So many big blue crabs

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:28,180
I signed up for the Internet, uncle

7
00:00:28,180 --> 00:00:29,180
Hygienic and yellow

8
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:34,930
Is this a mutation?

9
00:00:39,790 --> 00:00:42,070
This is butter crab

10
00:00:42,070 --> 00:00:45,230
Butter crab is a magnetic crab variation of blue crab

11
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,230
Because the crab paste in the body is too full

12
00:00:48,230 --> 00:00:51,100
melted into golden fat

13
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:52,100
seeped out

14
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:54,100
So it looks golden

15
00:00:55,100 --> 00:01:02,760
Then the butter crab should be more expensive than the blue crab, right?

16
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:03,760
Of course

17
00:01:03,760 --> 00:01:05,760
The most expensive blue crab can be sold for three yuan per pound

18
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:07,760
Butter crabs cost as little as four yuan a pound.
